{"id":"haken","lemma":"Haken","pos":"noun","rank":2254,"glosses":["hook (a rod bent into a curved shape)","hook punch","a sudden sharp turn, feint"],"ipa":"/ˈhaːkŋ̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/88/De-Haken.ogg/De-Haken.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Hakens","plural":"Haken"},"formAudio":{"Hakens":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Hakens.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Wo ist der Haken?","en":"What's the catch?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394501","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Es gibt einen Haken.","en":"There's a snag.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/178108","words":[null,null,{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"there is, there are"]]},{"text":"Häng deinen Mantel an den Haken.","en":"Hang your coat on the hook.","words":[{"g":"to hang","l":"hängen"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},{"g":"coat, overcoat"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Hänge deinen Hut auf den Haken.","en":"Hang your hat on the hook.","words":[{"g":"slope, hill, hillside","l":"Hang"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},{"g":"hat"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Er hängte seine Jacke an einen Haken.","en":"He hung his jacket on a hook.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to hang","l":"hängen"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"jacket"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]}]}